OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground closed while Asian
OL,4,Ahornet nest removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA playground has been closed while an
OL,7,FAsian hornet nest is removed.
OL,9,FInfrastructure and Environment said the
OL,10,Fplay area in Millennium Park, St
OL,11,FHelier, would stay shut throughout
OL,12,FMonday and possibly Tuesday while the
OL,13,Fnest was extracted.
OL,15,FThe Jersey Asian Hornet Group recorded
OL,16,F694 nests last year, a significant
OL,17,Fincrease on the 259 found in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
