OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground closed while Asian
OL,4,Ahornet nest removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has classified Asian
OL,7,Fhornets as an invasive species because
OL,8,Fthey are aggressive predators of native
OL,9,Finsects and are a threat to honeybees
OL,10,Fas one hornet can kill up to 50 bees a
OL,11,Fday.
